{"id":"nevesta","lemma":"невеста","pos":"noun","rank":1528,"glosses":["fiancée, bride","marriageable girl"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"невесты","plural":"невесты"},"examples":[{"text":"Где твоя невеста?","en":"Where is your fiancée?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Том — отец невесты.","en":"Tom is the bride's father.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"father"},null]},{"text":"Это моя невеста.","en":"That's my fiancée.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"У меня даже нет невесты.","en":"I don't even have a single girlfriend.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"even"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null]},{"text":"Невеста была ослепительна.","en":"The bride was radiant.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}